tel 1.0

name fuel

# The format of Fuel's configuration, `.pyrocosm/fuel/config.tel`: `Workspace.schema` reads
# this file, and holds the `store` and each `section` of a configuration to it. A member which
# may be written as an atom on its keyword's line, or as a child beneath it, is listed before
# those which may not, since atoms are assigned to members in order: `section guide doc` is a
# section whose `name` is `guide` and whose `path` is `doc`.

record Store
  description
      The Orthant store which holds the documents: the directory it is in, which has
      `.orthant` in it. Whatever the configuration names within the store's working tree is
      read from the store, in each language its axis of languages has, and not from the
      files checked out there. Each `at` is a value of another of its axes, as
      `release=1.2.0`, or a value alone where one axis has it, which the documents are read
      at; an axis nothing names is read at its last value, where its values are one line.
  field path String
  field at String optional repeatable

record Section
  description
      A section of documents: its name, which the address of each of its documents begins
      with, and its directory within the project's. `language` is the language it is written
      in, which a section held in an Orthant store need not say, the store's first language
      being that; `metadata` is the file, within the directory, which says what a reader is
      told of the section, to the schema `section`; each `overlay` is a directory of the
      API's documentation, and each `glossary` a file of terms, within it too.
  field name String
  field path String
  field language String optional
  field metadata String optional
  field overlay String optional repeatable
  field glossary String optional repeatable

record Sync
  description
      A tracker whose open issues the API's pages show: its kind, as `github`, and what it
      tracks, as `propensive/fuel`.
  field tracker String
  field repository String

document
  field store Store optional
  field section Section optional repeatable
  field classpath String optional repeatable
  field scalac-option String optional repeatable
  field session Flag optional
  field fixtures String optional
  field source String optional repeatable
  field overlay String optional repeatable
  field schema String optional repeatable
  field imports String optional repeatable
  field glossary String optional repeatable
  field check-links Flag optional
  field output String optional
  field sync Sync optional repeatable
  field present-port String optional
  field serve Flag optional
  field port String optional
